@page "/data/location-management"
<PageTitle>Location Management - Immich ReverseGeo</PageTitle>
<h2>Location Management</h2>
<LocationManagementNav />
<section class="settings-card">
    <p>Scan existing location names, review proposed corrections, and apply only the changes you select.</p>
    <div class="data-grid">
        <a class="data-link-card" href="/data/location-management/scan"><span class="data-card-title">Scan &amp; Review</span><span class="data-card-meta">Compare current names with proposed values before making changes</span></a>
        <a class="data-link-card" href="/data/location-management/scans"><span class="data-card-title">Saved Scans</span><span class="data-card-meta">Review saved results and apply selected differences</span></a>
        <a class="data-link-card" href="/data/location-management/history"><span class="data-card-title">Change History</span><span class="data-card-meta">Inspect results, resume pending work, and undo selected changes</span></a>
    </div>
    <p>Scanning is read-only. Applying changes writes the exact reviewed city, state, and country names to Immich;
        no reset or processing run is needed. Take an Immich database backup before applying corrections.</p>
    <p>Changed coordinates or location names are skipped. Undo also checks the metadata revision, so it cannot overwrite a later edit.
        Interrupted writes with an uncertain outcome are marked Needs review and must be checked in Immich.</p>
</section>
